00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:26.000
What might a service look like? So a little bit of planning, even though you're not going to be there, about how you want your life to be after you're gone. So all these things you're talking about, you can hit on a lot of hot, controversial buttons within your own family finances, family members, loved ones. How do you recommend bringing it up? I mean, do you bring this up at your holiday gathering or do you do it via email? I mean, is it particular to each situation, I imagine, but how do you recommend people go about it? You're right. Every family is going to be different. Every family has its own style,
追悼会可能会是什么样子？所以，做一点规划——尽管你不在场——关于你希望在你离去后生活是怎样的。所以你谈论的所有这些事情，都可能会触及你家庭内部许多敏感、有争议的雷区，比如财务、家庭成员、亲人。你建议如何提起这个话题？我的意思是，你是选择在节日聚会上提起，还是通过电子邮件？我想每种情况都有所不同，但你建议人们如何着手呢？你说得对。每个家庭都是不同的。每个家庭都有自己的风格，

