aiding them in these types of decisions and online tools. Can you talk about that research, what you found? Our goal, originally our goal was to try to figure out how we can help people know their preferences, know their family members' preferences for the things we've been talking about better. Because when you survey family members and ask them to predict how an older mother or older father would want to be taken care of, family members are notoriously bad at being able to predict those things with any accuracy. In fact, some of our research suggests that you might be just as accurate picking a person at random off the
帮助他们做出这些类型的决策以及在线工具。你能谈谈那项研究以及你发现了什么吗？我们的目标，最初我们的目标是试图找出如何帮助人们更好地了解他们的偏好，了解他们的家人对我们一直在讨论的事情的偏好。因为当你调查家庭成员并要求他们预测年迈的母亲或年迈的父亲希望如何被照顾时，家庭成员在能够准确预测这些事情方面出了名的糟糕。事实上，我们的一些研究表明，你随便在街上拉一个人，

