00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:42.000
street and asking them to guess what your mom or dad would want at the end of his or her life. So our first goal was to try to figure out, could we educate people and help them become more knowledgeable? And so that's one aim of this research. The second aim, though, and I think it's become a more important goal for me, is simply to get people who feel more comfortable talking about these things. As you said at the beginning, these are difficult things for people to bring up. They're not sure how to do it. But we know it's important for them to plan. and to think ahead. So we want to give people a sense of confidence and competence that they know how to bring up these topics and they can have a conversation and it can turn into some product or
让他们去猜你的爸爸或妈妈在生命终点时想要什么，其准确度可能也差不多。所以我们的第一个目标是试图弄清楚，我们能否教育人们并帮助他们变得更有见识？这就是本研究的一个目的。然而，第二个目标，我认为它对我来说已经成为一个更重要的目标，就是简单地让那些感觉更习惯谈论这些事情的人参与进来。正如你在开头所说，对人们来说，提起这些事情很困难。他们不确定该怎么做。但我们知道规划和提前思考对他们很重要。因此，我们希望赋予人们一种自信和能力，让他们知道如何提起这些话题，他们可以进行对话，并且这可以转化为某种产品或

